#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: man-amor.6.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrición"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: man-amor.6.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>AMOR</acronym> stands for <quote>Amusing Misuse Of Resources</quote"
">. It provides several different characters who prance around your X screen"
" doing tricks and giving you tips."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>AMOR</acronym> son as siglas en inglés de «uso incorrecto pero"
" entretido dos recursos». Fornece varias personaxes distintas que se pasean"
" pola pantalla facendo trucos e dándolle consellos."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: man-amor.6.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcións"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: man-amor.6.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&amor; is configured graphically, and does not have any commandline options"
" other than the standard &kde; and &Qt; options."
msgstr ""
"&amor; pode configurarse de maneira gráfica, e non ten ningunha opción da"
" liña de ordes aparte das opcións estándar de &kde; e &Qt;."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: man-amor.6.docbook:45
